{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u201cYour Friend Wiggles\u201d is the nightmare that lurks in the night, the remorse that has haunted you since childhood, and the fear of abandonment you\u2019ve carried with you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/1aa3f1b02a14e900761be222cd5b95e2.poster.avif?t=1761557969\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/1aa3f1b02a14e900761be222cd5b95e2.webm?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/1aa3f1b02a14e900761be222cd5b95e2.mp4?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this terrifying walking simulator, you will meet those virtual pets you once forgot in a drawer, and who now seek revenge, in an atmosphere full of mystery and secrets waiting to\u00a0be\u00a0uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/59abb62828a3314b19bafb961200f86a.poster.avif?t=1761557969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/59abb62828a3314b19bafb961200f86a.webm?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/59abb62828a3314b19bafb961200f86a.mp4?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wiggles loves you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wiggles is the pet you cared for as a child. You gave it love and affection and promised you would always cherish it, but that didn\u2019t stop you from locking it away in a drawer and forgetting it forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Wiggles has awakened. It has met other pets who were also cast aside by their children, and together they have endured the worst of fates. Don\u2019t think escaping will be so easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/e4c8f639e4884a9548b4470cfcdf7ebc.poster.avif?t=1761557969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/e4c8f639e4884a9548b4470cfcdf7ebc.webm?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/e4c8f639e4884a9548b4470cfcdf7ebc.mp4?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the way out.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a forest, not knowing what has happened. You only have a small device that feels familiar. How will you escape? You have one night to figure it out \u2014 but be careful, because a strange creature lurks in the shadows, and it won\u2019t hesitate\u00a0to\u00a0attack\u00a0you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/78bc811b9b7949f8c714874933f75f2d.poster.avif?t=1761557969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/78bc811b9b7949f8c714874933f75f2d.webm?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/78bc811b9b7949f8c714874933f75f2d.mp4?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What will you find in &quot;Your Friend Wiggles&quot;?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person psychological horror</strong> with a dark and oppressive atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the <strong>six keys</strong> to escape from that terrifying place and uncover Wiggles\u2019 secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in an immersive experience</strong> where sound and atmosphere take the spotlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>short and intense experience</strong>, where the environment gains deep meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro graphics</strong> that give it a unique personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A nightmare tale</strong> you must uncover by playing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized environments</strong> and events make each playthrough unique.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978710?t=1761557969","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/54ebbd4354b453ac214b1795d8074edda140b74f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761557969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/372307a0c8c4a94c00f6393950d8afe6ec7d77c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761557969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/372307a0c8c4a94c00f6393950d8afe6ec7d77c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761557969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features horror themes with a dark atmosphere, mild jump scares, and non-explicit violence. While unsettling at times, it does not contain graphic or realistic depictions of gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u201cYour Friend Wiggles\u201d is the nightmare that lurks in the night, the remorse that has haunted you since childhood, and the fear of abandonment you\u2019ve carried with you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/1aa3f1b02a14e900761be222cd5b95e2.poster.avif?t=1761557969\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/1aa3f1b02a14e900761be222cd5b95e2.webm?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978710/extras/1aa3f1b02a14e900761be222cd5b95e2.mp4?t=1761557969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this terrifying walking simulator, you will meet those virtual pets you once forgot in a drawer, and who now seek revenge, in an atmosphere full of mystery and secrets waiting to\u00a0be\u00a0uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style